OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm restoring a WW2 fighter plane
OL,4,Aon my driveway'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost people use their driveways to park
OL,7,Ftheir cars, but one aircraft enthusiast
OL,8,Fhas turned his into a workshop to
OL,9,Frebuild an iconic World War Two fighter
OL,10,Fplane.
OL,12,FJulian Mitchell is currently six years
OL,13,Finto the process of restoring a 1941
OL,14,FHawker Hurricane, and recently
OL,15,Frelocated the project outside his home
OL,16,Fin Kirtlington, Oxfordshire.
OL,18,FThe Hurricane played a key role in the
OL,19,Fskies throughout Britain's conflict
OL,20,Fwith the Axis powers, and has been
OL,21,Fdescribed as the "unsung hero" of the
OL,22,FBattle of Britain.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
