OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm restoring a WW2 fighter plane
OL,4,Aon my driveway'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitchell said he had been interested in
OL,7,Frebuilding vintage aeroplanes for a
OL,8,Flong time, and described the
OL,9,Frestoration of the iconic single-seat
OL,10,Ffighter as his "dream project".
